    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668ea8e90d938b0b670022e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668ea8e90d938b0b670022e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 15:29:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当独立、自助的生活不能再维持时，我们该怎么办？在生命临近终点的时刻，我们该和医生谈些什么？应该如何优雅地跨越生命的终点？</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊老病死的问题~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️Show Notes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 死亡观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 对死亡的新认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 医学延长寿命的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 寿多则辱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 安乐死会让我们对待生命的态度更潦草吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 临终关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 开启“艰难的对话”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 功能性女儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 养老焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 幻想中的葬礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 美好的养老生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈奕迅-今天只做一件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>Guns N' Roses - Knockin' On Heaven's Door</span></p>]]></description>
