  <item>
    <title>EP02. 当我们终于读完《第二性》II</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6667cad5c26e396a36e4d387</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6667cad5c26e396a36e4d387</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jun 2024 03:56:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「如果她专心于学习、运动、职业训练，或某种社会政治活动，就不会整天想着男人，对自己的感情或对性冲突的关注，也会小得多。然后，在把自我实现为一个独立的个人方面，她仍会面临比年轻男人更多的困难。如我指明的，家庭和社会习俗都不会赞成她在这方面作出努力。而且，她即使选择了独立，也仍会在自己的生活中给男生爱情腾出一块地方。她很可能是在担心，如果完全献身于某项事业，她会错过自己的女人命运。」</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✍️Show Notes</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 彩礼是不是出卖女性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 反彩礼必须反婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a> 女性爱做家务？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> 警惕对女性的“赞美”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 母性是天生的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 女性与自然的天然连接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> 男性的畏惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 女鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 妓女更淫乱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 服美役</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 向下的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 真的有女权男吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 女性内部分裂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 如何避免“作为女人的不幸”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 服美役</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2987">49:47</a> 向下的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3244">54:04</a> 真的有女权男吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3583">59:43</a> 女性内部分裂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4219">1:10:19</a> 如何避免“作为女人的不幸”？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>📚Others</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34896921/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34896921/"><span>上野千鹤子《父权制与资本主义》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>🎵BGM</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Colbie Caillat-Try</span></p>]]></description>
