  <item>
    <title>EP01. 当我们终于读完《第二性》I</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6653ef3dc59d1e5757e13dee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6653ef3dc59d1e5757e13dee</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 02:26:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「但凡男人写女人的东西都是值得怀疑的，因为男人既是法官又是当事人。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了更深入了解自己，了解女性，我们斗胆聊下这部描写女性问题最全面作品——波伏娃《第二性》。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✍️Show Notes</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> “很多有阅读习惯的女权主义者都没有看过第二性”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 卵子是被动的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 精神分析里的性别歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 女孩子要乖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 言情小说的对于女生的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 历史上女性的处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 宗教对于女性的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> “失控”的青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 月经羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 性不是占有，而是各取所需</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">50:14</a> 生育对于女性来说是不是诅咒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3208">53:28</a> “歇斯底里”的更年期</span></p><span></span><h2><span>📚Others</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/30258045/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/30258045/"><span>费孝通《生育制度》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35318021/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35318021/"><span>奥黛丽·迪万《正发生》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>🎵BGM</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Colbie Caillat-Try</span></p>]]></description>
